<title>GERMANY: May air cargo at Munich airport up 32.8pct.</title>
<headline>May air cargo at Munich airport up 32.8pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air cargo flown to and from Munich airport (MUC) grew 32.8 percent year-on-year in May, airport authority figures showed.</p>
<p>The following table shows cargo handled at Munich airport in May and for the year to date in tonnes and with year-on-year percentage changes.</p>
<p>		   May    Pct change    Jan-May   Pct change</p>
<p>    Exports   3,793   Up 41.5	 18,442     Up 33.0</p>
<p>    Imports   3,561   Up 30.4	 17,474     Up 17.1</p>
<p>    Transit     494   Down 1.0	 3,196     Up 18.2</p>
<p>    Total     7,848   Up 32.8	 39,112     Up 24.2</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706; Fax: 5017 - www.racs.com</p>
